# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# Required for real question generation, interviewing, and grading.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: enables voice mode (spoken interviews). Used ONLY for the audio
# edge — streaming speech-to-text and the interviewer's voice.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional: fake the voice transport for offline dev (no OpenAI key needed).
# VOICE_FAKE=1

# Optional: set to 1 to run the whole app offline with deterministic fixtures
# (no API key needed, no cost). Used by tests automatically.
# LLM_MOCK=1

# Optional: override where the SQLite database lives (defaults to data/natalie.db).
# DATABASE_PATH=data/natalie.db
